# Willawan site conventions

Read `AGENTS.md` for full project context. Follow these constraints on every change:

- Static GitHub Pages site only: edit `index.html`, `style.css`, and assets. No framework/build step unless explicitly requested.
- User-facing copy stays **Swedish**. Prefer answering the maintainer in Swedish.
- Do not remove or casually rename `CNAME` (`www.willawanthaimassage.se`).
- Keep Bokadirekt booking URL identical across all CTAs; use `target="_blank"` + `rel="noopener noreferrer"` on external links.
- New sections need matching `id`, header nav link, and footer link.
- Do not change address, phone, prices, or opening hours without business confirmation.
- Prefer small, matching HTML/CSS fixes over redesigns.
